		{
			dependencies: ["39E77F847F1D48D3"]
			description: [
				"高级蜜蜂可以帮助你收集资源。建造动物棚或住所需要大量资源，蜜蜂可以为你制造它们。 &2在蜜蜂之书里，一切都解释得非常详细。&r"
				"&dIn addition there is no conflict with the DragN's O-Bees they work just like the vanilla bees and can be put in the cages and advanced beehives but since they are really small its harder to see them.&r"
